  "title": "Intoxicating Onion Soup",
  "description": "For garlic and onion lovers. This soup requires twenty, yes twenty, cloves of garlic and four cups of red wine. The resulting soup is rich, very fragrant, and seasoned generously with thyme.",
  "authors": [
